  triage:title "ATM_CHAT_ID not tracked in env-var-boundary lint" ;
  triage:description "ATM_CHAT_ID isn't tracked in the env-var-boundary lint the way ATM_TEAM/ATM_IDENTITY are. No active leak today; future-enforcement gap only. The lint-config.toml [env_var_boundary].forbidden_env_vars list includes ATM_TEAM and ATM_IDENTITY but omits ATM_CHAT_ID, which should be treated as a client-boundary variable alongside the other CLI-identity environment variables." ;
